- `az keyvault certificate show --vault-name kv-chad-prd --name chad-partner-client --query attributes.expires`', N'ready', NULL, 0, 519, N'aiko.appadmin@keigan.local', '2026-11-08 12:00:00.000000', '2027-02-06 12:00:00.000000'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000092', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000003e', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000043', N'payment-api code context', N'code_context', N'keigan-knowledge-payment-api.md', N'text/markdown', 1222, N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000003e/00000000000040008000000000000091.md', N'917cb6196685877c4da9d9ba7c422aaed9b5be9549a6eb846162eeff4ebfca33', N'# payment-api

## Purpose
Takes premium payments and pays out claims for Payments Platform (AU). It calls the partner bank to authorise and settle every payment.

## Runtime and hosting
- Kotlin, Spring Boot 3, AKS namespace `payments`, 4 replicas. Entry through payments-apim.

## Entry points and APIs
| Method | Path | Handler | Notes |
|---|---|---|---|
| POST | /v1/payments | PaymentController.create | idempotent on `paymentReference` |
| GET | /v1/payments/{id} | PaymentController.get | |

## Outbound dependencies
| Dependency | Protocol | Timeout | Retry |
|---|---|---|---|
| Partner bank gateway | HTTPS | 12 s | 2 retries |
| payment-confirmation-func | Service Bus | 15 s | dead-letter after 5 |

## Logging and telemetry
Application Insights role name `payment-api`. Custom event `PartnerBankCall` with `durationMilliseconds` and `partnerStatus`.

## Known failure modes
- Partner bank latency: calls exceed the 12 s timeout, payments stay `PENDING`, retries amplify load. Confirm with `PartnerBankCall` p95 above 10 s. Pause automatic retries via the feature flag `payments.retry.enabled=false` and notify the partner bank contact.

## Owners
Team AU-Payments-Platform. Support group AU-Payments-Support.
', N'["payment-api", "Purpose", "Runtime and hosting", "Entry points and APIs", "Outbound dependencies", "Logging and telemetry", "Known failure modes", "Owners"]', N'### Purpose
Takes premium payments and pays out claims for Payments Platform (AU). It calls the partner bank to authorise and settle every payment.

### Key facts
- Kotlin, Spring Boot 3, AKS namespace `payments`, 4 replicas. Entry through payments-apim.
- POST — /v1/payments — PaymentController.create
- GET — /v1/payments/{id} — PaymentController.get

### Outbound dependencies
- Partner bank gateway — HTTPS — 12 s
- payment-confirmation-func — Service Bus — 15 s

### Known failure modes
- Partner bank latency: calls exceed the 12 s timeout, payments stay `PENDING`, retries amplify load. Confirm with `PartnerBankCall` p95 above 10 s. Pause automatic retries via the feature flag `payments.retry.enabled=false` and notify the partner bank contact.', N'ready', NULL, 0, 306, N'aiko.appadmin@keigan.local', '2026-11-08 12:00:00.000000', '2027-02-06 12:00:00.000000');
