    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000006b', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000006a', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006', 0, N'claims-api', N'# claims-api', 4, N'{"claims-api": 2, "claims": 2, "api": 2}'),
    (N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000006c', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000000006a', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', N'00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006', 1, N'Purpose', N'## Purpose
Core REST API of Claims Processing (JP). It accepts claim submissions from the customer portal and agent desktop, validates them, stores them in SQL and orchestrates assessment and payout.
Callers: claims-apim (all external traffic), claims-intake-func (batch intake). Dependants: claims-document-renderer, claims-workflow.', 84, N'{"purpose": 2, "core": 1, "rest": 1, "api": 1, "claims": 5, "processing": 1, "jp": 1, "accepts": 1, "claim": 1, "submissions": 1, "customer": 1, "portal": 1, "agent": 1, "desktop": 1, "validates": 1, "them": 2, "stores": 1, "sql": 1, "orchestrates": 1, "assessment": 1, "payout": 1, "callers": 1, "claims-apim": 1, "apim": 1, "all": 1, "external": 1, "traffic": 1, "claims-intake-func": 1, "intake": 2, "func": 1, "batch": 1, "dependants": 1, "claims-document-renderer": 1, "document": 1, "renderer": 1, "claims-workflow": 1, "workflow": 1}'),
